---
title: Sources - Vintage Story Wiki
description: How each top-level page was built -- which raw game files feed it, and how.
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "{{ lang }}/sources/index.html"
---
{% import "macros/breadcrumb.njk" as bc %}
{{ bc.trail(lang, [{label: "Sources"}]) }}
<h1>Sources</h1>
<p>
  Every page on this wiki is generated from the game's own raw asset files, never hand-maintained
  -- this section exists so that's checkable, not just claimed. One page per top-level listing,
  naming the exact raw file globs it reads and how they're processed into what you see.
</p>
<div class="grid-list">
{% for src in pipelineSources %}
  <a href="{{ ('/' ~ lang ~ '/') | url }}sources/{{ src.id }}/">
    <strong>{{ src.title }}</strong>
    <span class="muted">{{ src.globs.length }} file glob{% if src.globs.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
  </a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
